{
    "_doc": "ErAV NTR Part 3 - F toy collector, day seven: 'acceptance' (draft F). Single client; every ending (error path included) runs ResolveEvent and ReleaseFallbackWorker. COM: com_sex_P_missionary. The 'demonstration for the supervisor' beat stays narration (the return demo belongs to the release event). The 'toy registration card' is narration only (no data hook).",

